n\n-3.55%\n\n# NEAR Protocol Price Chart\n## Analyze NEAR Protocol's price, market capitalization, and historical performance with our interactive NEAR chart.\n$4.65$5.05\n\n$0.8633$5.92\n\n### Price And Performance\n#### How has the price of NEAR Protocol changed in the last 24 hours?\n###### 0.00%\n\nIn the last 24 hours, the price of **NEAR** has changed by **-3.55%** and is currently trending **downward**, with a price of **$4.70**.\n\n[11] NEAR Protocol Price (NEAR) in USD - Live Updates\nhttps://coinranking.com/coin/DCrsaMv68+nearprotocol-near\n# NEAR Protocol Price\n$1.838\n\n-5.21%\n\n## Exchange Listings\n| Exchanges | NEAR price | 24h trading volume | Fee Discount | Fee Discount |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Binance logo Binance | $1.84 | $56.35 million | 20% | Trade |\n| KuCoin logo KuCoin | $1.84 | $40.49 million | 20% | Trade |\n| BTCC logo BTCC | $1.83 | $22.90 million | 0% | Trade |\n| CoinW logo CoinW | $1.84 | $18.43 million | 15% | Trade |\n| Toobit logo Toobit | $1.84 | $18.16 million | 20% | Trade |\n\n## Spot Markets\n| Exchanges | NEAR price | Volume | Fee Discount |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| NEAR / USDT Binance | $1.84 | $45.81 million | 20% | Trade |\n| NEAR / USDT KuCoin | $1.84 | $40.34 million | 20% | Trade |\n| NEAR / USDT BTCC | $1.83 | $22.90 million | 0% | Trade |\n| NEAR / USDT Toobit | $1.84 | $18.16 million | 20% | Trade |\n| NEAR / USDT CoinW | $1.84 | $16.05 million | 15% | Trade |\n\n## Futures Markets\n| # | Markets | Close Price | Open Interest | Funding Rate |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | NEAR / USDT Bybit | $1.84 | $79.25 million | 0.010% |\n| 2 | NEAR / USD Hyperliquid | $2.00 | $73.98 million | 0.0010% |\n| 3 | NEAR / USDT Binance | $1.84 | $72.81 million | 0.010% |\n| 4 | NEAR / USDT KuCoin | $1.84 | $30.61 million | 0.010% |\n| 5 | NEAR / USDT Bitget | $1.84 | $30.15 million | 0.010% |\n\n## Historical Data\nMinutes Hours Days Weeks Months Years\n\n| Date | Close | Change | Market Cap | Trading Volume |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Today | $1.84 | +0.03% | $2.39 billion | $277.62 million |\n\n[12] NEAR Protocol Price Today\nhttps://www.coinbird.com/cryptocurrencies/near-protocol/overview\n1 NEAR Protocol currently costs $3.9095. Over the past 24 hours, the price is down 8.1%, with a trading volume of $580.03M.\n\n# NEAR Protocol price\nToday’s NEAR Protocol price, chart, and market data\n\n$3.9095 · Current price\n$5.12B · Market cap Market cap Market capitalization is the total value of all coins of a cryptocurrency currently in circulation. It is calculated by multiplying the number of coins in circulation by the current price of a single coin.\n\\-8.1% · 24h change\n\\+84.1% · 1y change\n\n## NEAR Protocol market overview\n### Price data\n$3.9095 · Current price\n$20.44 -80.9% · All-Time High (Jan 16, 2022) All-Time High (Jan 16, 2022) The all-time high refers to the highest price a cryptocurrency has ever reached. It marks the point at which the cryptocurrency’s value hit its previous peak, based on available historical data.\n\n## Frequently asked questions about NEAR Protocol\n### What is the current price of NEAR Protocol?\nThe current price of NEAR Protocol is $3.9095.  NEAR Protocol is the 21st largest cryptocurrency by market cap, currently at $5.12B.\n\n## NEAR Protocol price comparison\nNEAR Protocol\n\n(NEAR)\n\n$3.9095\n\nNEAR Protocol\n\n(NEAR)\n\n$3.9095\n\n$91.76\n\n$3.9095\n\n$3.9095\n\n{\"name\":\"NEAR Protocol\",\"offers\":{\"price\":\"3.91\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\"}}\n\n[13] NEAR Protocol Price (NEAR/USD) Today\nhttps://www.binance.com/en/price/near-protocol\nLive price of NEAR Protocol is $5.377287 with a market cap of $6.28B USD.\n\n# NEAR Protocol Price (NEAR)\nNEAR\n\n1 NEAR ≈ USD $5.377287\n\nNEAR to USD:\n\n1 NEAR Protocol equals $ 5.377287 USD+7.73%1D\n\n## Price of NEAR today\nThe live price of NEAR Protocol is $ 5.377287 per (NEAR / USD) with a current market cap of $ 6.28B USD. 24-hour trading volume is $ 266.86M USD. NEAR to USD price is updated in real-time. NEAR Protocol is +7.73% in the last 24 hours with a circulating supply of 1.17B.\n\nNEAR Price History USD\n\n| Date Comparison | Amount Change | % Change |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Today | $ 0.386061 | +7.73% |\n\n{\"name\":\"NEAR Protocol\",\"offers\":{\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"lowPrice\":5.38,\"price\":5.38}}\n\n[14] NEAR Protocol Price Today\nhttps://www.kucoin.com/price/NEAR\n# NEAR Protocol Price\n## $4.39\nThe live price of NEAR Protocol is $4.39, with a total trading volume of $ 21.24M in the last 24 hours. The price of NEAR Protocol changed by +1.61% in the past day, and its USD value has increased by +0.34% over the last week. With a circulating supply of 1.31B NEAR, the market cap of NEAR Protocol is currently 5.76B USD, marking a +1.61% increase today.\n\n24h Low$4.29\n\n- NEAR/USDT 5 Spot Margin $4.39+1.61%\n\n[15] NEAR Protocol Price Today\nhttps://digitalcoinprice.com/coins/near-protocol\nNEAR Protocol price today is 3.79 USD. Convert NEAR to USD with real-time data, including market cap, 24h trading volume, live charts, price prediction, and price history.\n\n# NEAR Protocol Price (NEAR)\n$3.79 8.32%\n\n## NEAR Protocol Price Chart Live\n$4.14\n\n$3.74\n\n$4.14\n\n## About NEAR Protocol\n### How Much is a One NEAR Protocol Worth Now?\nThe current price of the NEAR Protocol(NEAR) is **$3.79**, with a current market cap $4,972,770,116.70.\n\n### NEAR Protocol Price Prediction\nThe NEAR Protocol current price is $3.79.\n\n### NEAR Protocol Price Live Data\nNEAR Protocol price today is $3.79 USD, which is Down by -8.32% over the last 24 hours. There has been an hourly Rise by 0.88%. NEAR Protocol's market cap currently sits at $4,972,770,116.70 USD, holding up for a market cap rank at #18.\n\n{\"name\":\"NEAR Protocol NEAR\",\"offers\":{\"price\":\"3.79\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\"}}\n\n[16] NEAR Price News: Correction Reaches $4.10, $4.00 Support Next - COINOTAG\nhttps://en.coinotag.com/near-protocol-slides-30-from-peak-test-400-support\nNear Protocol (NEAR) slipped to about $4.10, testing $4.00 support after a 30% slide from its October peak. XRP, ZEC and SHIB face key levels.\n\n# Near Protocol (NEAR) Slides 30% From Peak to Test $4.00 Support\n2026-11-03**COINOTAG**\n\nNear Protocol (NEAR), a Layer 1 blockchain protocol, traded around $4.10 early on Tuesday, extending a short-term correction that has taken the token roughly 30% below its October peak near $5.90.\n\n[17] NEAR Protocol Price: NEAR/USD Live Price Chart, Market Cap & News Today\nhttps://coingecko.com/en/coins/near?amp=&amp=\nPrice of NEAR Protocol (NEAR) today is $5.24 with a 24-hour trading volume of $1,431,822,538.\n\nNEAR $5.24\n\n12.2%\n\n# NEAR Protocol NEAR Price\n$5.24\n\n$4.67 24h Range $5.27\n\n## NEAR Historical Price\n- **24h Range**: $4.67 – $5.27\n\n## NEAR Protocol Markets\nAffiliate disclosures\n\nSpot\n\nPerpetuals Futures\n\n| # | Exchange |  | Pair | Price | Spread | +2% Depth | -2% Depth | 24h Volume | Volume % | Last Updated |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Coinbase Exchange Coinbase Exchange | CEX | NEAR/USD | $5.26 | 0.01% | $1,324,033 | $2,334,363 | $70,359,187 | 4.54% | Recently |\n\n## NEAR Protocol (NEAR) price has increased today.\nThe price of NEAR Protocol (NEAR) is $5.24 today with a 24-hour trading volume of $1,431,822,537.62. This represents a 12.20% price increase in the last 24 hours and a 2.50% price increase in the past 7 days.\n\n{\"name\":\"NEAR Protocol\",\"currentExchangeRate\":{\"price\":5.236211568198708,\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\"}}\n\n{\"name\":\"NEAR Protocol\",\"offers\":{\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"price\":\"5.236211568198708\"}}\n\n[18] NEAR Protocol Price Analysis: Price today, NEAR to USD Live Price Chart, Market Cap, Token Value\nhttps://sosovalue.com/coins/near-protocol\nNEAR Protocol live price is 4.706 USD with a 24-hour trading volume of 1486898287 USD.\n\n# NEAR Protocol\n## NEAR Protocol Price Live Data Report a Data Error\nThe live NEAR Protocol price today is $4.706 USD with a 24-hour trading volume of 1,486,898,287 USD. We update our NEAR Protocol to USD price in real-time. NEAR Protocol is -6.83% in the last 24 hours. The current SoSoValue marketcap ranking is # 22, with a live market cap of $ 6,157,799,583 USD.\n\n## 8)Bullishness index for this token from the perspective of token valuation and future potential from Chatgpt 4\nAs of the latest available data, NEAR Protocol (NEAR) is valued at around $1.85, with a market capitalization of approximately $1.85 billion and a circulating supply of over 1 billion NEAR coins.\n\n[19] How low NEAR Protocol price go?\nhttps://fxstreet.com/cryptocurrencies/news/near-protocol-forecast-bearish-move-extends-despite-house-of-stake-issuance-cut-approval-202611030611\n# NEAR Protocol Forecast: Bearish move extends despite House of Stake issuance cut approval\nNEAR Protocol (NEAR) trades below $4 on Tuesday, following a 10% loss the previous day and three consecutive weeks of decline.\n\n## Technical outlook: Will NEAR extend its decline?\nNEAR token trades at $3.8270 at press time on Tuesday, indicating a bearish reversal on the four-hour chart.\n\nFrom a technical perspective, NEAR's decline is capped by a tight band of two parallel trendlines, forming a falling channel pattern on the same chart. The price approaches the lower-boundary trendline near $3.7303, guarding the downside toward the $3.4030 horizontal support set by the September 19 low.\n\n{\"name\":\"How low NEAR Protocol price go?\",\"articleBody\":\"This decision will programmatically lower long-term inflation and supply growth.Retail demand returnsRetail interest in NEAR Protocol shows signs of building after a mild contraction phase. Source: CoinGlassTechnical outlook: Will NEAR extend its decline?NEAR token trades at $3.8270 at press time on Tuesday, indicating a bearish reversal on the four-hour chart. Know more.)\"}\n\n[20] NEAR Protocol price enters issuance reform spotlight\nhttps://ad-hoc-news.de/boerse/news/marktberichte/near-protocol-price-enters-issuance-reform-spotlight/70447172\n# NEAR Protocol price enters issuance reform spotlight\n## What NEAR investors are watching\n- Investing.com displayed NEAR at 4.6034 USD, with a market capitalization of 5.98 billion USD and 24-hour volume of 610.47 million USD when the page was read.\n\n## Quote and project context\nWhen read for this report, the Investing.com market page displayed NEAR at 4.6034 USD at 17:12:12."}}}],"usage":null}

